The '''Pest Wrangler''' is an [[NPC]] that only appears in {{zone|The Garden}}. They will only appear under {{NPCSprite|Finnegan}}'s Blooming Business Perk. They only ask for items that attract pests. Completing their offer will reward the player with a total of {{Item|Fine Flour|amount=6}}.

